The three real applications ICDEV[OS]'s modernisation samples are tested on (ICDEV[OS] Phases 253-257,
examples/modernisation/apps.yaml there) are third-party open-source applications. This directory holds only what
ICDEV[IT]'s tools derived from their source, statically and without a model (icx-mdz-03, icx-mdz-04):

    <app>.apptwin.json   the icos-apptwin/v1 bundle (tools/modernization/apptwin_export.py), against ICDEV[OS]
                         contract 1.189.0: the features and processes with their evidence, capability hints, step
                         signatures and reviews, the sections map, the 7R's confidence and unmeasured criteria, and
                         the waves derived before any plan, all inline
    <app>.gaps.json      the run's report: every step, every section present or missing with why, and the
                         application's environment (none is declared for these three: they are deployed nowhere)

The <app>.features.json side files (icx-mdz-03) are retired: everything they carried is in the bundle.

Regenerated with tools/modernization/sample_pipeline.py --no-model on a scratch database (--at
2026-11-16T00:00:00Z), at the commits pinned in ICDEV[OS]'s apps.yaml, with that file's cloud and AI targets. Nothing
in them is hand-filled. Their source is never committed here.

